// GPDK045 native Cadence adaptation; NOT a performance-matched paper reproduction.
// Missing device sizes/values use recorded defaults; see plan.json and classification CSV.
// Explicit body nets, including deliberately floating bodies, are preserved.
// PDK_BULK_N/PDK_BULK_P, where present, require an external bulk bias.
// Evidence: /projects/2022B4AA1300P/SchematicGeneration/Papers_dataset/consolidated_paper_dataset_final_locked/agnibha_mixed_pdk_20261008/cases/p03_fig1_sziklai_amplifier
// Original comments below describe the pre-conversion topology:
// original: Manually traced from batch2/images/p03_fig1_sziklai_amplifier.png.
// original: Topology reference, not a Cadence export or simulation-qualified deck.
// original: Numeric node names 0..7 are the node numbers printed in the image.
// original: Node 4 is the external +18 V VCC rail; node 6 is VOUT; node 0 is ground.
// original: No extra supply-source device has been inserted into the reference graph.
// original: QP and QN terminals are ordered Collector, Base, Emitter (C B E).
// original: Both devices are three-terminal BJTs, not MOSFETs. No body pin is drawn.
// original: 'pnp' and 'npn' are polarity/model placeholders. Actual BJT model cards
// original: and a VCC testbench supply are required before numerical simulation.
// original: VIN is marked 1 kHz / 10 mV. The image does not specify peak versus RMS;
// original: ampl=10m below uses the peak convention and is not a verified RMS claim.
// original: The pinned Cadence importer and GED adapter do not support PNP. Do not
// original: silently drop QP or reinterpret it as a MOSFET/current source for GED.
simulator lang=spectre
global 0
include "/linuxeda_new/c2scadence/FOUNDRY/analog/45nm/models/spectre/gpdk045.scs" section=tt

// Library name: AgnibhaMixedPDK_20261008
// Cell name: c18_e4b9ffeb71
// View name: schematic
RL (_6 0) resistor r=85
RP (_7 0) resistor r=4.2k
RE (_4 _5) resistor r=1
R2 (_3 0) resistor r=250k
R1 (_4 _3) resistor r=80k
Rs (_1 _2) resistor r=1
VIN (_1 0) vsource dc=0 type=sine freq=1k ampl=10m
C1 (_2 _3) capacitor c=100n
QP (_7 _3 _5 ) g45vpnp10 area=100.0 m=1
QN (_5 _7 _6 ) g45vnpn10 area=100.0 m=1
